{"id": "0291", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "官長也要對百姓宣告說：『誰建造房屋，尚未奉獻，他可以回家去，恐怕他陣亡，別人去奉獻。 誰種葡萄園，尚未用所結的果子，他可以回家去，恐怕他陣亡，別人去用。", "target": [5, 20, 5], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "holdout", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 18.2834375, "sha256": "8f8dfc66a57f04a0c5637a92a1a2f84950a6e97673126702aabab2104496d23d", "transcript": "官长也要对百姓宣告说,谁建造房屋,尚未奉献,他可以回家去,恐怕他阵亡,别人去奉献。谁种葡萄园,尚未用所结的果子,他可以回家去,恐怕他阵亡,别人去用。", "decode_s": 1.7594739169580862, "cpu_s": 0.130811, "rtf": 0.09623321199627181, "max_rss_bytes": 823640064, "edits": 0, "units": 65, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null, "normalized": "官長也要對100姓宣告說,誰建造房屋,尚未奉獻,他可以回家去,恐怕他陣亡,別人去奉獻。誰種葡萄園,尚未用所結的果子,他可以回家去,恐怕他陣亡,別人去用。", "normalization_s": 7.91249331086874e-05, "baseline_reference": null, "baseline_reference_s": 0.0001263750000000101, "optimized_reference": null, "optimized_reference_s": 6.0708000000005315e-05, "quote_top3": [[5, 20, 5], [5, 20, 6], [5, 20, 8]], "quote_scores": [1, 0.6021505376344086, 0.45544554455445546], "baseline": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7633147918367833, "correct_within_3s": true}, "optimized": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7632491248367832, "correct_within_3s": true}, "v2_reference": null, "v2_inhibited": false, "v2_phonetic": "guan zhang ye yao dui bai xing xuan gao shuo , shui jian zao fang wu , shang wei feng xian , ta ke yi hui jia qu , kong pa ta zhen wang , bie ren qu feng xian 。 shui zhong pu tao yuan , shang wei yong suo jie de guo zi , ta ke yi hui jia qu , kong pa ta zhen wang , bie ren qu yong 。", "v2_prepare_s": 9.112499999999812e-05, "strict": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7628484169009253, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.85": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7628484169009253, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.88": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7628484169009253, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.90": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7628484169009253, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.92": {"actual": [5, 20, 5], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.7628484169009253, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic_candidate": null, "phonetic_similarity": 0}
{"id": "0292", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "有爭訟的事，他們應當站立判斷，要按我的典章判斷。在我一切的節期必守我的律法、條例，也必以我的安息日爲聖日。 他們不可挨近死屍沾染自己，只可爲父親、母親、兒子、女兒、弟兄，和未嫁人的姊妹沾染自己。", "target": [26, 44, 24], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "holdout", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 21.61375, "sha256": "3142baff758744edfbf7b9fc8ea46a3ed2b05a20d6a83ff71a06ddaf56547297", "transcript": "有征颂的是,他们应当战利判断,要按我的典章判断,在我一切的节旗必守我的律法、条例,也必以我的安息日为圣日,他们不可哀尽死尸染自己,只可为父亲、母亲、儿子、女儿、弟兄、捍卫嫁人的姐妹沾染自己。", "decode_s": 1.8896697089076042, "cpu_s": 0.22798600000000002, "rtf": 0.08742905367683092, "max_rss_bytes": 823640064, "edits": 12, "units": 83, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null, "normalized": "有徵頌的是,他們應當戰利判斷,要按我的典章判斷,在我1切的節旗必守我的律法、條例,也必以我的安息日爲聖日,他們不可哀盡死屍染自己,只可爲父親、母親、兒子、女兒、弟兄、捍衛嫁人的姐妹沾染自己。", "normalization_s": 0.00010720896534621716, "baseline_reference": null, "baseline_reference_s": 0.0001440419999999989, "optimized_reference": null, "optimized_reference_s": 8.249999999999602e-05, "quote_top3": [[26, 44, 24], [26, 44, 25], [26, 20, 16]], "quote_scores": [0.8606060606060606, 0.5084745762711864, 0.3418803418803419], "baseline": {"actual": [26, 44, 24], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.8965360429555296, "correct_within_3s": true}, "optimized": {"actual": [26, 44, 24], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.8964745009555295, "correct_within_3s": true}, "v2_reference": null, "v2_inhibited": false, "v2_phonetic": "you zheng song de shi , ta men ying dang zhan li pan duan , yao an wo de dian zhang pan duan , zai wo yi qie de jie qi bi shou wo de lü fa 、 tiao li , ye bi yi wo de an xi ri wei sheng ri , ta men bu ke ai jin si shi ran zi ji , zhi ke wei fu qin 、 mu qin 、 er zi 、 nü er 、 di xiong 、 han wei jia ren de jie mei zhan ran zi ji 。", "v2_prepare_s": 0.00016904200000000458, "strict": {"actual": [26, 44, 24], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.8962980438633008, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.85":