{"id": "0297", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "他們無論往何處去，耶和華都以災禍攻擊他們，正如耶和華所說的話，又如耶和華向他們所起的誓；他們便極其困苦。 耶和華興起士師，士師就拯救他們脫離搶奪他們人的手。", "target": [7, 2, 15], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "holdout", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 17.18525, "sha256": "1197242553eaa0e8468e08dac0a9041cc3ac3761cca157f2104d72861671c2ee", "transcript": "他们无论往何处去,耶和华都已在或攻击他们,正如耶和华所说的话,又如耶和华向他们所起的事,他们便极其困苦。耶和华兴起事实,事实就证就他们脱离抢罗他们人的手。", "decode_s": 1.6052980839740485, "cpu_s": 0.11261600000000005, "rtf": 0.09341138964949876, "max_rss_bytes": 823640064, "edits": 11, "units": 70, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null, "normalized": "他們無論往何處去,耶和華都已在或攻擊他們,正如耶和華所說的話,又如耶和華向他們所起的事,他們便極其困苦。耶和華興起事實,事實就證就他們脫離搶羅他們人的手。", "normalization_s": 9.766698349267244e-05, "baseline_reference": null, "baseline_reference_s": 7.095800000000452e-05, "optimized_reference": null, "optimized_reference_s": 5.2082999999996106e-05, "quote_top3": [[7, 2, 15], [7, 2, 16], [2, 9, 12]], "quote_scores": [0.8428571428571429, 0.34408602150537637, 0.3142857142857143], "baseline": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.6114790420488896, "correct_within_3s": true}, "optimized": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.6114601670488895, "correct_within_3s": true}, "v2_reference": null, "v2_inhibited": false, "v2_phonetic": "ta men wu lun wang he chu qu , ye he hua dou yi zai huo gong ji ta men , zheng ru ye he hua suo shuo de hua , you ru ye he hua xiang ta men suo qi de shi , ta men bian ji qi kun ku 。 ye he hua xing qi shi shi , shi shi jiu zheng jiu ta men tuo li qiang luo ta men ren de shou 。", "v2_prepare_s": 8.837499999999921e-05, "strict": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.611263459952265, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.85": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.611263459952265, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.88": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.611263459952265, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.90": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.611263459952265, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.92": {"actual": [7, 2, 15], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 1.611263459952265, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic_candidate": null, "phonetic_similarity": 0}
{"id": "0298", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "亞比篩對大衛說：「現在 神將你的仇敵交在你手裏，求你容我拿槍將他刺透在地，一刺就成，不用再刺。」 大衛對亞比篩說：「不可害死他。有誰伸手害耶和華的受膏者而無罪呢？」", "target": [9, 26, 8], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "holdout", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 17.178875, "sha256": "ebc491f93c007869f221e35ab130851e0b8b13fdabaf1e4696bcda816d7d134b", "transcript": "雅比塞对大魏说,现在神将你的仇敌交在你手里,求你容我拿枪将他刺透在地,一次就成,不用再刺。大魏对雅比塞说,不可害死他,有谁伸手害耶和华的受高者而无罪呢?", "decode_s": 2.0242358749965206, "cpu_s": 0.12360700000000002, "rtf": 0.1178328543048669, "max_rss_bytes": 823640064, "edits": 8, "units": 68, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null, "normalized": "雅比塞對大魏說,現在神將你的仇敵交在你手裏,求你容我拿槍將他刺透在地,1次就成,不用再刺。大魏對雅比塞說,不可害死他,有誰伸手害耶和華的受高者而無罪呢?", "normalization_s": 8.091598283499479e-05, "baseline_reference": null, "baseline_reference_s": 6.408299999999656e-05, "optimized_reference": null, "optimized_reference_s": 6.62500000000108e-05, "quote_top3": [[9, 26, 8], [9, 26, 9], [9, 24, 10]], "quote_scores": [0.8823529411764706, 0.4583333333333333, 0.31666666666666665], "baseline": {"actual": [9, 26, 8], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 2.0295686650530502, "correct_within_3s": true}, "optimized": {"actual": [9, 26, 8], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 2.0295708320530506, "correct_within_3s": true}, "v2_reference": null, "v2_inhibited": false, "v2_phonetic": "ya bi sai dui da wei shuo , xian zai shen jiang ni de chou di jiao zai ni shou li , qiu ni rong wo na qiang jiang ta ci tou zai di , yi ci jiu cheng , bu yong zai ci 。 da wei dui ya bi sai shuo , bu ke hai si ta , you shui shen shou hai ye he hua de shou gao zhe er wu zui ne ?", "v2_prepare_s": 8.487500000000381e-05, "strict": {"actual": [9, 26, 8], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 2.0296534159801083, "correct_within_3s": true}, "phonetic-0.85": {"actual": [9, 26, 8], "correct": true, "wrong": false, "rejected": false, "total_s": 2.0296534159801083, "correct_with